    narr:narration """This hub centers on the [core product differentiator](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture), which defines the system's value as the capture of decision artifacts at the exact moment of consensus. Recent retrospectives from August 2026 have sought to [marshal evidence](narr:Position_Sprint4SuccessEvidenceMarshaling) for the success of this model. The team reports that they have [shipped the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787650473508_1), framing this milestone as a [key unlock](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787650473508_3) facilitated by the Zephyr integration. Alongside these functional milestones, the team highlights a [velocity of 23 points](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787650473508_2), marking their highest output for the quarter. The current narrative trajectory links these concrete delivery metrics directly to the foundational thesis of decision capture, positioning the recent technical integration as the primary driver of both process efficiency and product capability.""" ;
